    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Centro, a business process outsourcing company, ranked in the Top 500 of the 2026 OA500 Global Outsourcing Firm Index, the annual ranking of the world&#8217;s top BPO providers published by Outsource Accelerator. Centro delivers customer support, digital transformation, and healthcare outsourcing from delivery centers in North America, Asia, the Middle East, and Africa.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
